    formula. Density's separate exp(-sigma*length) has an unrelated argument and cannot be reused
    as a Gaussian. Alpha<=0 already avoids all bucket evaluation. Bucket-product updates remain
    per interval, including all three native contributions; neither far bucket nor small weights
    may be omitted without a separately approved numerical contract.
  An experimental algebraic reduction evaluated w0,w1 normally and used
